Comment: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:36.81,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.44,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:44.22,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思议了...
Comment: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:47.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:50.29,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人无法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:56.18,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狭窄的道路上  我们巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:59.20,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立马就被你那黑洞一样的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:01.25,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和夸张
Comment: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:03.27,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}为何会让我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.87,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能会下雨
Comment: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:12.13,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午饭吧
Comment: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:15.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在阳光下尽情享受着日光浴
Comment: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:18.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}这小可爱到底是何方神圣
Comment: 0,0:01:19.19,0:01:22.41,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}从今往后  我都是属于你的了
Comment: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:25.49,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}过度的深爱  让时空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:29.39,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不觉间  你已经成为了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:30.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:31.79,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}让我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:34.96,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}说是命运也好  奇迹也罢
Comment: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:38.03,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我们的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:41.96,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中悬挂的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.04,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}纯然的爱不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:48.96,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身边...
